  "title": "Week 28: I Do NOT like moving 😭",
  "date": "2026-07-18T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 28: I Do NOT like moving 😭\n\nLast month, I moved out of Karu. As I was busy on my PhD Application, I asked that if I can be transferred to Räägu dorm.\n\nStill, my contract can only hold for a month. So last week, I was busy looking for a new place for me. Eventually, I found this hostel Larsen.ee, which is also suggested by my colleague.\n\nThe room is not big, about 16 $m^2$. And half of it was the bathroom. There is a murphy bed, so I can fold it when I do not sleep.\n\nEach room, there is a poster in front of it. Mine is parasite. Which is kind of funny. The only asian poster, and I am probably the only eastern asian in the floor.\n\nParasite\n\nThere is a co-working place. I believe I will use that a lot, considering the small room. And a rooftop, where can see the sea view.\n\nLidl is just right next to the building I live. This is actually a very good news for me.\n\nThe total expense, rent + facilities + electricity ... are around 500 EUR. It is more expansive, I remember my classmates two years ago, he rent a room like this. It only costed him 440 EUR, and it was in the city center.\n\nAfter moving for one day, I am exhausted. Next two weeks, I will be teaching at school. I need to change one bus to get to school. Like 40 minutes' traffic.",
